  Select Search Mode
  Choose Gemini-native search behavior.

  1. Tavily            Use client web_search/web_fetch tools.
  2. Grounding         Use built-in google:search grounding.
› 3. Hybrid (current)  Use both client web tools and google:search.
  4. Off               Disable Gemini search tools.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
